{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104714","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104714/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104714/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104714/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104714","id":2955258711,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6QgtLF","number":104714,"title":"Fix elements getting added to render_list too often","user":{"login":"JanPschwietzer","id":74722144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NzIyMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74722144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer","html_url":"https://github.com/JanPschwietzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-28T07:28:54Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T20:20:23Z","closed_at":"2025-03-28T16:10:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104714","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104714.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104714.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"In Godot 4.4, enabling gizmos in the editor causes a significant increase in draw calls and rendered objects compared to 4.3, resulting in performance degradation. This issue occurs because certain surfaces are being added to multiple render lists, causing them to be drawn multiple times unnecessarily.\r\n\r\nSolution\r\nThe fix prevents surfaces from being added to both the opaque and alpha render lists simultaneously. The logic now ensures:\r\n- Opaque surfaces without alpha components are added only to the normal render list\r\n- Surfaces with opaque flags that pass the alpha flag (or when alpha is forced) are added only to the alpha render list\r\n- No surface is added to both lists simultaneously\r\n\r\nBefore: Surfaces could be added to both lists\r\n\r\nImpact\r\nThis change significantly reduces the number of draw calls when gizmos are enabled, bringing performance in line with Godot 4.3 behavior. The fix maintains correct rendering while eliminating redundant draw operations.","closed_by":{"login":"JanPschwietzer","id":74722144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NzIyMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74722144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer","html_url":"https://github.com/JanPschwietzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanPschwietzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104714/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104714/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}